    <Notes ShowOnLoad="1" Notes="Drawer divider box 3x3: external 330 x 330 x 120 mm, 4 mm material, open top.&#10;Parts: 1 x Base, 2 x Side A (330 mm long), 2 x Side B (330 mm long). Finger joints, no glue needed but recommended.&#10;Needs 3 sheets: parts on layers 'Sheet 2' onwards are parked right of the bed - move each sheet's parts onto the bed for its run.&#10;Layer settings (8 mm/s, 100%, kerf 0.1 mm) are a starting point - test on scrap and adjust."/>
</LightBurnProject>
